# Context is the repository root (docker build -f web/Dockerfile .). Only the
# engine source (typescript/) and the dashboard (web/) are needed; everything
# else is excluded, and nothing built or secret on the host is ever copied.
*
!typescript
!web
typescript/node_modules
typescript/dist
web/node_modules
web/.next
web/out
web/build
web/coverage
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
web/blob-report
web/.vercel
web/.env*
!web/.env.example
**/*.tsbuildinfo
web/next-env.d.ts
web/Dockerfile
web/docker-compose*.yml
